\newlabel{fig:trajectory_null_t_3p0437}{{3}{14}{Trajectory and local block diagnostics for the low-escape frequency $t=3.0437$. Left: real path compared with random-sign absolute null envelopes on the $\sqrt K$ scale and on the intrinsic variance scale. Right: logarithmic block diagnostics. The path remains below the typical null envelopes even though the signed block increments fluctuate on a normal local scale}{figure.3}{}}
